class=\"metric-title\">活跃且产生收入的专门 AI 陪伴 App</div>\n      <div class=\"metric-note\">头部 10% 获取约 89% 品类收入</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p1-left\">\n    <div class=\"section-kicker\">收入与需求分层</div>\n    <div class=\"block-head\">收入重心在北美，陪伴需求尚未普及化</div>\n    <div class=\"region-box\">\n      <div class=\"region r1\"><div class=\"pct\">45%</div><div class=\"regname\">北美</div></div>\n      <div class=\"region r2\"><div class=\"pct\">25%</div><div class=\"regname\">亚洲</div></div>\n      <div class=\"region r3\"><div class=\"pct\">21%</div><div class=\"regname\">拉美</div></div>\n      <div class=\"region r4\"><div class=\"pct\">19%</div><div class=\"regname\">北美/欧洲</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"small-note\">过去 12 个月收入区域分布；口径以素材为准</div>\n\n    <div class=\"need-box\">\n      <div class=\"need-title\">美国成人与青少年的使用信号存在明显差异</div>\n      <div class=\"demand-line\">\n        <div class=\"demand-dot\"></div>\n        <span>美国成人：仅 <b>4%</b> 用聊天机器人获取陪伴；<b>10%</b> 用于情绪支持或建议</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"demand-line\">\n        <div class=\"demand-dot\"></div>\n        <span>青少年口径更宽：近四分之三曾使用，约一半定期使用</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-note\">不同调查定义与样本，不可直接比较</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p1-right\">\n    <div class=\"routes-title\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"section-kicker\">四条竞争路线</div>\n        <div class=\"block-head\">玩家围绕不同的关系与分发飞轮建立壁垒</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small\">并非同一产品逻辑</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"route-grid\">\n      <div class=\"route-card\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M32 48S12 37 12 23c0-7 5-11 11-11 4 0 7 2 9 5 2-3 5-5 9-5 6 0 11 4 11 11 0 14-20 25-20 25Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>关系深度</h4>\n        <p>长期记忆与人格一致性，提升持续陪伴的可感知价值。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"route-card\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect x=\"13\" y=\"14\" width=\"38\" height=\"35\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M21 28h22M21 37h15\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>角色/内容生态</h4>\n        <p>UGC、角色、剧情与 Feed，形成内容消费和创作循环。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"route-card\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"25\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"25\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 51c2-9 9-13 15-13M37 38c7 0 13 4 15 13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>真人社交增益</h4>\n        <p>匹配、破冰、对话与治理，服务真人关系结果。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"route-card\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"21\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"44\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M25 25l5 13M39 25l-5 13M26 21h12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h4>平台捆绑</h4>\n        <p>依托既有社交图谱与跨产品分发降低获客门槛。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"route-foot\">判断重点：<b>关系价值、内容供给、真人结果与平台分发</b>，将导向不同留存与变现结构。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"insight\">\n    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M16 42h32M20 38V26M32 38V17M44 38V22\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"24\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"15\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"20\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    品类已成立，竞争关键是不同关系与分发飞轮能否穿越留存、成本与合规约束\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"source\">来源：Sensor Tower、Appfigures、Pew Research、Common Sense Media</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"page-label\">Page 02</div>\n  <h1 class=\"title\">中国竞争已分化为三条价值路线，关系治理正在重写增长函数</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">综合角色平台、垂直内容社区与真人社交 AI 增益并行发展；治理要求从附属能力转为增长前提</p>\n\n  <div class=\"route3\">\n    <div class=\"strategy-card\">\n      <div class=\"strategy-top\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 48h18M32 42v6M23 28h5M36 28h5\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>综合 AI 角色平台</h3>\n      </div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>猫箱：</b>2026Q1 中国 iOS 生成式 AI 应用收入第 1</li>\n        <li>累计移动端消费者支出超 <b>2,200 万美元</b>（第三方估算）</li>\n        <li><b>星野/Talkie：</b>2025 年前 9 个月合计平均 MAU <b>2,005.1 万</b>、收入 <b>1,875 万美元</b>，广告约占 <b>60%</b>（合并口径）</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"strategy-card\">\n      <div class=\"strategy-top\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M19 16h26v32H19z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M25 25h14M25 33h14M25 41h9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M45 20l7-5v32l-7-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>垂直内容/IP 社区</h3>\n      </div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>筑梦岛：</b>接近 <b>500 万</b>注册用户</li>\n        <li>约 <b>80%</b> 年轻女性</li>\n        <li>逾 <b>50 万</b> 创作者</li>\n        <li>公司口径经媒体转引</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"strategy-card\">\n      <div class=\"strategy-top\">\n        <div class=\"round-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"25\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"25\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M13 49c2-9 8-13 15-13M36 36c8 0 13 4 15 13M31 26h3M32 20v12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>真人社交 AI 增益</h3>\n      </div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><b>Soul：</b>平均 DAU <b>1,100 万</b></li>\n        <li><b>AI Boosters：</b>日均活跃用户 <b>460 万</b></li>\n        <li>Soul 平台收入非 AI 收入，AI 收入不可独立拆分</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"gov-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"gov-title\">关系治理要求：从产品边界进入全链路运营</div>\n    <div class=\"gov-sub\">新规自 <span class=\"label-red\">2026-07-15</span> 起施行；治理门槛同时影响触达、留存、危机响应与退出机制</div>\n    <div class=\"gov-date\">关系治理流程</div>\n    <div class=\"gov-flow\">\n      <div class=\"gov-step\">\n        <h4>01｜入口与分龄</h4>\n        <p>年龄识别；分龄设计；明确未成年人使用边界。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"gov-step\">\n        <h4>02｜关系过程监测</h4>\n        <p>识别依赖与过度使用信号，建立预警与干预机制。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"gov-step\">\n        <h4>03｜高风险处置</h4>\n        <p>高风险危机干预，保障异常情境下的响应能力。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"gov-step\">\n        <h4>04｜身份与权利</h4>\n        <p>AI 身份标识；数据复制、退出删除等用户权利。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"insight\">\n    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M32 10 49 17v13c0 12-7 20-17 25-10-5-17-13-17-25V17l17-7Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"m23 32 6 6 12-13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    下一轮集中度更可能由关系治理与单位经济共同推动\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"source\">来源：Sensor Tower、港交所材料、36Kr；新规自 2026-07-15 起施行</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"page-label\">Page 03</div>\n  <h1 class=\"title\">海外没有稳定通吃者，竞争围绕五个控制点分工</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">独立 App、内容网络与平台型玩家分别占据关系、创作、规模和分发入口；可持续经营取决于治理闭环</p>\n\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <div class=\"control-card\">\n      <div class=\"control-num\">01</div>\n      <h4>AI 娱乐/创作者网络</h4>\n      <div class=\"player\">Character.AI</div>\n      <p>AI-native Feed 串联内容消费、角色互动与再创作。</p>\n      <div class=\"micro-flow\"><span>观看</span><i></i><span>对话</span><i></i><span>Remix</span><i></i><span>创建</span><i></i><span>发布</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"control-card\">\n      <div class=\"control-num\">02</div>\n      <h4>移动规模与变现</h4>\n      <div class=\"player\">CHAI（自报）</div>\n      <p><b>1,000 万+</b>用户、<b>2,500 万+</b> Chat AIs、<b>8,500 万美元</b>年化 B2C 收入。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:8px\">广告从每 <b>8</b> 条消息一次降至每 <b>16</b> 条一次，D30 留存相对提升 <b>18.5%</b>。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"control-card\">\n      <div class=\"control-num\">03</div>\n      <h4>长期关系</h4>\n      <div class=\"player\">Replika / Nomi / Kindroid</div>\n      <p>长期陪伴、记忆与人格是核心价值主张。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:8px\">Replika <b>4,200 万+</b>为累计用户，不是 MAU。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:8px\">Zeta 在日本增长突出（第三方估算）。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"control-card\">\n      <div class=\"control-num\">04</div>\n      <h4>平台分发</h4>\n      <div class=\"player\">Meta AI / AI Studio</div>\n      <p>嵌入 Instagram、Messenger、WhatsApp 与独立 App。</p>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:8px\">既有社交图谱与跨产品入口构成分发优势。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"control-card\">\n      <div class=\"control-num\">05</div>\n      <h4>真人关系结果</h4>\n      <div class=\"player\">Tinder / Bumble</div>\n      <p>AI 辅助推荐、匹配与表达，不替代真人承担关系结果。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bridge-box\">\n    <div class=\"bridge-title\">关系治理桥梁：六道待验证门槛支撑可持续经营</div>\n    <div class=\"bridge-sub\">治理不是单点审核，而是把年龄、关系风险、权利与安全评估嵌入产品和运营流程</div>\n\n    <div class=\"reg-left\">\n      <b>监管触点｜中国</b>\n      中国规则<br>2026-07-15 施行\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reg-right\">\n      <b>监管触点｜海外</b>\n      FTC / 加州 SB 243<br>英国 Ofcom<br>欧盟 AI Act 第 50 条<br>2026-08-02 起适用\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bridge-stage\">\n      <div class=\"bridge-deck\">可持续经营</div>\n      <div class=\"pier-row\">\n        <div class=\"pier\">年龄识别<br>未成年人边界</div>\n        <div class=\"pier\">依赖与过度使用<br>预警</div>\n        <div class=\"pier\">危机干预</div>\n        <div class=\"pier\">AI 身份验证</div>\n        <div class=\"pier\">数据权利</div>\n        <div class=\"pier\">安全评估</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bridge-base\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"insight\">\n    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M10 43h44M16 43V28h10v15M38 43V21h10v22M26 32h12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M18 25 32 12l14 13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    独立 App 需要把一个控制点闭合成关系或网络优势，才能抵消平台的分发优势\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"source\">来源：Character.AI、CHAI、Replika、Meta、Tinder/Bumble 等公司披露；FTC、Ofcom、欧盟委员会</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"page-label\">Page 04</div>\n  <h1 class=\"title\">2026–2029 的赢家不是更长聊天时长，而是可持续的「关系操作系统」</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">增长情景的分水岭在关系连续性、创作者与真人价值、单位经济及可规模化治理能否共同成立</p>\n\n  <div class=\"anchor\">\n    <div class=\"anchor-label\">2026 移动 IAP 锚点</div>\n    <div class=\"anchor-num\">1.5 亿美元（2026Q1）</div>\n    <div class=\"anchor-note\">简单年化运行率约 <b>6 亿美元</b>（非完整 TAM）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scenario-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"scenario-title\">2029 增长情景：以简单年化运行率为起点的分支测算</div>\n    <div class=\"scenario-grid\">\n      <div class=\"scenario down\">\n        <div class=\"scenario-arrow\"></div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-name\">下行｜假设 CAGR 10%</div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-result\">约 8.0 亿美元</div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-text\">未成年人入口收紧、低留存及平台免费捆绑</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"scenario base\">\n        <div class=\"scenario-arrow\"></div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-name\">基准｜假设 CAGR 30%</div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-result\">约 13.2 亿美元</div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-text\">记忆、语音、角色生态与多元变现改善增长质量</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"scenario up\">\n        <div class=\"scenario-arrow\"></div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-name\">上行｜假设 CAGR 50%</div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-result\">约 20.3 亿美元</div>\n        <div class=\"scenario-text\">多模态、创作者网络效应与可规模化合规共同成立</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pyramid-area\">\n    <div class=\"pyramid-title\">长期平台可能性金字塔：五层能力均待证明</div>\n    <div class=\"pyramid\">\n      <div class=\"layer l5\"><span class=\"pyr-num\">5</span><span><b>安全治理/全球本地化</b>｜年龄识别、危机干预、AI 标识、数据权利、地区运营</span></div>\n      <div class=\"layer l4\"><span class=\"pyr-num\">4</span><span><b>单位经济/商业模式</b>｜推理与审核成本、毛利、广告+订阅+消耗型权益</span></div>\n      <div class=\"layer l3\"><span class=\"pyr-num\">3</span><span><b>真人价值/平台分发</b>｜匹配成功、有效破冰、真人关系结果</span></div>\n      <div class=\"layer l2\"><span class=\"pyr-num\">2</span><span><b>创作者/IP 供给</b>｜优质角色、活跃创作者、Remix/发布率、分成透明</span></div>\n      <div class=\"layer l1\"><span class=\"pyr-num\">1</span><span><b>关系连续性</b>｜30/90 日关系留存、记忆命中率、人格稳定性</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"kpi-area\">\n    <div class=\"kpi-title\">经营跟踪指标条</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"mini-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M32 49S15 39 15 25c0-7 5-11 11-11 3 0 5 1 6 4 2-3 4-4 7-4 6 0 10 4 10 11 0 14-17 24-17 24Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/></svg></div>\n        <div><h4>关系连续性</h4><p>30/90 日关系留存、记忆命中率</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"mini-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path d=\"M16 16h32v32H16zM23 27h18M23 37h12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n        <div><h4>创作者网络</h4><p>活跃创作者、Remix/发布率</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"mini-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"24\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"24\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d